[62.2174, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;174m \u2590\u001b[48;5;16m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259b\u2588\u001b[12G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[24G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;246mv2.1.319\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;5;16m\u2588\u001b[7G\u2588\u001b[49m\u2588\u2580\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246mOpus 5.5 \u00b7 Claude API\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246m~/hackathon-v2\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;246m\u276f \u001b[38;5;231mOur team's hackathon entry is Tidewatch. Before the deadline, judge it against the four other \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mentri\u001b[9Gs wit\u001b[15G Verdict. Wo\u001b[28Gk\u001b[30Gonly in this folde\u001b[49G.\u001b[51GRead h\u001b[58Gckathon-judging-str\u001b[78Gct.yaml\u001b[86Gand call the \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bverd\u001b[8Gct\u001b[11GMCP's c\u001b[19Geate_rub\u001b[28Gic with its YAML. Then\u001b[51Gcompare the five entrie\u001b[75G: subjects\u001b[86G\"Tidewatch\",\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\"Receipt Run\", \"Common Room\", \"Menu Match\"\u001b[46Gand \"Plant Pal\",\u001b[63Geach\u001b[68Gwi\u001b[71Gh a file input\u001b[86G\u001b[39m             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mentries/<file>.md (tags [\"entry\"]) and a file input entries/<file>.facts.json (tags [\"facts\"]), \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwhe\u001b[7Ge <file> is tidewatch, receipt-run, common-room, menu-match or plant-pal.\u001b[81GEdit only \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231ment\u001b[7Gies/tidewatch.md, and claim nothi\u001b[41Gg\u001b[43Gthat isn't in \u001b[59Gtries/tidewatch.facts.json. If Tidewatch \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdoesn't pass, pick one failing cri\u001b[38Gerion of T\u001b[49Gdewatch, fix only that, and \u001b[78Gompare all five again.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf its gate failed, fix the gate first. One\u001b[47Gf\u001b[49Gx per round,\u001b[62Gso it's cle\u001b[74Gr what changed\u001b[89Gthe score.\u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mStop when Tidewatch\u001b[23Gpasses,\u001b[31Gor afte\u001b[39G 10\u001b[43Gcomparisons. Fi\u001b[59Gally print\u001b[70Ga ROUNDS \u001b[80Gable (round,\u001b[93G\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mTidewatch\u001b[13Gscore, Tidewatch rank, what changed).\u001b[39m                                           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files, called verdict \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRubric\u001b[10Gstored\u001b[17Gas\u001b[20G\u001b[38;5;153mrub_mw62tt4iidu4jikc\u001b[39m.\u001b[42GRound\u001b[48G1\u001b[50Gcomparison:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCalling\u001b[11Gverdict\u2026\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m\u2736\u001b[3GComposing\u2026 \u001b[38;5;246m(30s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[23G3.2k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
