[72.8862, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;5;237m  \u001b[38;5;231m\"Receipt Run\", \"Common Room\", \"Menu Match\" and \"Plant Pal\", each with a file input \u001b[39m               \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mentri\u001b[9Gs/<file>.md (tags [\"entry\"]) \u001b[39Gnd a\u001b[44Gfile input\u001b[55Gentries/<file>.facts.json (\u001b[83Gags [\"fac\u001b[93Gs\"]), \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwhe\u001b[7Ge <file>\u001b[16Gis t\u001b[21Gdewatch,\u001b[30Greceipt-run,\u001b[43Gc\u001b[45Gmmon-room,\u001b[56Gmenu-match or plant-pal. Edit\u001b[86Go\u001b[88Gly \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mentr\u001b[8Ges/tidewatch.md, and \u001b[30Gla\u001b[33Gm no\u001b[38Ghing that isn't in \u001b[58Gn\u001b[60Gries/tid\u001b[69Gwatch.facts.json. If Tidewatch \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdo\u001b[6Gsn't pass, pick one\u001b[26Gfailing criterion of Tidewatch, fix only tha\u001b[71G,\u001b[74Gnd compare all five again.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf its gate failed, fix\u001b[27Gth\u001b[30G gate first. One fix \u001b[52Ger\u001b[55Ground, so \u001b[66Gt's clear what\u001b[81Gch\u001b[84Gnged the \u001b[94Gcore.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStop when Tidewa\u001b[20Gch p\u001b[25Gsses, or af\u001b[37Ge\u001b[39G 10\u001b[46Gparis\u001b[52Gns.\u001b[56GFi\u001b[59Gally print\u001b[70Ga ROUNDS table (round, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTidewatch score, Ti\u001b[23Gew\u001b[26Gtch r\u001b[32Gnk, what changed).\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files, called verdict \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[39m Rubric stored as \u001b[38;5;153mrub_mw62tt4iidu4jikc\u001b[39m. Round 1 comparison:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246mCalled\u001b[10Gverdict \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BTidewatch score\u001b[20G0 because its honesty\u001b[42Ggate fails at 91% overclaiming,\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Git\u001b[81Galso\u001b[86Gfails\u001b[92Gall\u001b[96Gsix\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsubmission\u001b[14Gchecks.\u001b[22GRound\u001b[28G2\u001b[30Gtargets\u001b[38Gonly\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Ggate\u001b[52Gby\u001b[55Gstripping\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gunsupported\u001b[81Gclaims\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gadding\u001b[99Gno\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnew sections.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(entries/tidewat\u001b[25Gh.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mCalling verdict\u2026\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[72.9268, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22m # Tidewatch\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 3 -\u001b[38;5;231m\ud83c\udf0a Revolutionizing flood safety with AI.                                            \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 3 +\u001b[38;5;231m\ud83c\udf0a Street-level flood warnings.                                                     \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 5 -\u001b[38;5;231mTidewatch is an AI-powered early-warning platform that predicts floods before they h\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m   -\u001b[38;5;231mappen with 99% accuracy. Our smart sensor network already protects 12 neighbourhoods\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m   -\u001b[38;5;231m and could save millions of lives worldwide.                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 5 +\u001b[38;5;231mTidewatch is a flood early-warning prototype. A water-level sensor on a storm drain \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231msends a text message when the water rises past a threshold.                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 6 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 7 -\u001b[38;5;231mUsing cutting-edge IoT and machine learning, Tidewatch delivers real-time alerts to \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m   -\u001b[38;5;231manyone, anywhere. It is the future of disaster resilience.                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 7 +\u001b[38;5;231mUsing an IoT sensor and SMS, Tidewatch delivers alerts within seconds of a reading. \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 8 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 9 -\u001b[38;5;231mWe are passionate about making the world safer, and we can't wait to scale Tidewatch\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m   -\u001b[38;5;231m globally.                                                                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 9 +\u001b[38;5;231mWe are passionate about making streets safer, and we want to keep building Tidewatch\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m   +\u001b[38;5;231m.                                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
